<p class="lt-chem-371677">In the preceding activity, you developed a general rule that across a period, IE<sub>1</sub> increases with increasing atomic number, <em>Z</em>; down a group, IE<sub>1</sub> decreases with increasing <em>Z</em>. Look at Figure 1 below and make certain you see how the data in the figure support both trends. There are a few systematic deviations from these trends, which also can be seen in Figure 1.</p>

<div class="box-exercise">
